  dialogAfterOpen:
  - 'P.: Well, well, well. Where are you sneaking off to during work hours'
  dialogNPC:
  - "J.: Th-there\u2019s\u2026 there\u2019s a b-body! In the locker!"
  - 'P.: A body? What are you talking about. Stop slacking and get back to work.'
  - "J.: No, I-I swear, I\u2019m not making it up! Just look behind, the locker!
    Please!"
  - 'P.: Oh! You''re absolutely right. I suppose I''ll go to my office to call the
    authorities. Just wait here.'
  - 'J. In thoughts: *No way i will wait here, I should leave through the emergency
    exit *'
